<h3><u>Toot gayi aas meri toot gaayi aas</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p  gayi aas meri toot gaayi aas (2)</p>

<p  der hui mere chacha jaan ko sidhare (2)<br />
Akbaro baba hai gaye nehr kinare (2)<br />
Are amma mera qalb jala pyaas ke mare<br />
Haye pyaas ke mare<br />
Doobte jaate hai mere dil ke sahare</p>

<p  />
Abbas bohot kuch se tha zainab ko sahara<br />
Haaey aab koi nahi alame gurbat mei hamara</p>

<p  zehra yeh buka karti hai rokar (2)<br />
Tumse to dharas si mujhe mere beradar<br />
Baba ka farman hua aab tu mukaddar<br />
Hua aab tu mukaddar<br />
Cheen ke lejayenge ada meri chadar</p>

<p  />
Tum sharm se khaime mei bhi aye na biradar<br />
Haaye sheh llaye the jab laasha e qasim ko utha kar</p>

<p  ke sar kehti hai farwa mere abbas (2)<br />
Qatl hua ibne hassan mei hhui be aas (2)<br />
Aaye natum dene ko pursa bhi mere paas<br />
Pursa bhi mere paas<br />
Are hota hai aab tere haya daari ka ehsas</p>

<p  />
Tune mujh mehroomi mei kya shaan ata ki<br />
Haaye kulsum ko tadpayengi taa umer judaai</p>

<p  mei phirta hai abhi tak wohi manzar (2)<br />
Aashur ki shab teri wafa nakhsh hai dilpar (2)<br />
Array kya kehke tujhe roye kare nala yeh khwahar<br />
Haaye nala yeh khwahar<br />
Array aab tuhi bata de mujhe aye mere biradar</p>

<p  />
Asgar ki na jab dekhi gaayi tashan dahani<br />
Maine di tassaalli use aane ko hai paani</p>

<p  haaye mere nanhe se asgher ke chachajaan (2)<br />
Re banu e shabbir bohot tumpe thi naadan (2)<br />
Re pyaasi hi magar jayega ab asgher nadaan<br />
Haye asghere naadan<br />
Haaye ghar ke ujad jaane ka bhi hogaya samaan</p>

<p  />
Baarat bhatijiki chacha jaayenge lekar<br />
Array is aas mei atthara bars pala tha akbar</p>

<p  mera ab ban na sake ga kabhi dulha (2)<br />
Tukde huwa sab hasrato armaan ka kaleja (2)<br />
Hai armaan ka kaleja<br />
Kya dekhte hi dekhte hogaya bhayya</p>

<p  />
Sheh kehte the baaki na alamdaar na laashkar<br />
Array zainab ye badhado alam e dilbar e haider</p>

<p  ne maqtal mei anees is tarha likhkha (2)<br />
Woh sina zani aur qayamat ka tha girya (2)<br />
Sar peet te the zere alam dilbare zehra<br />
Hai dilbare zehra<br />
Haaye sukhe hue hoton pe tha purdard ye nawha</p>
</p>
